{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-145-1","title":"Psalms 145:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David praises God for his fame; 8 for his goodness; 11 for his kingdom; 14 for his providence; 17 for his justice, holiness, and saving mercy.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2989. B.C. 1015. (Title.) David's.This incomparable song of praise, which is the last of the acrostic or alphabetical Psalms, each verse beginning with a consecutive letter of the Hebrew alphabet, is supposed to have been composed by David towards the close of his life.</p>\n<p>Psalm of praise. 100:1; *title extol thee. 30:1; 68:4; 71:14-24; 103:1,2; Da 4:37 my God. 44:4; 45:1,6; 47:6-8; 48:2,3; 95:3; 149:2; Isa 33:22; Mal 1:14 Mt 25:34; Re 19:16 I will bless. 21; 30:12; 52:9; 113:1,2; 146:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-2","title":"Psalms 145:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Every day. 72:15; 119:164; Re 7:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-3","title":"Psalms 145:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Great. 48:1; 96:4; 147:5; Job 5:9; 9:10; Re 15:3 and his greatness is unsearchable. Heb. and of his greatnessthere is no search. 139:6; Job 5:9; 9:10; 11:7-9; 26:14; Isa 40:28; Ro 11:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-4","title":"Psalms 145:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>generation. 44:1,2; 71:18; 78:3-7; Ex 12:26,27; 13:14,15; De 6:7; Jos 4:21-24 Isa 38:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-5","title":"Psalms 145:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>will speak. 40:9,10; 66:3,4; 71:17-19,24; 96:3; 104:1,2; 105:2; Isa 12:4 Da 4:1-3,37 works. Heb. things, or, words. 72:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-6","title":"Psalms 145:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>And men. 22:22,23,27,31; 98:2,3; 113:3; 126:2,3; Jos 2:9-11; 9:9,10 Ezr 1:2; Jer 50:28; Da 3:28,29; 6:25-27; Hab 2:14 I will declare thy greatness. Heb. thy greatness I willdeclare it. 92:1,2; 107:21,22,31,32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-7","title":"Psalms 145:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>abundantly. 36:5-8; Isa 63:7; Mt 12:34,35; 2Co 9:11,12; 1Pe 2:9,10 sing. 36:10; 51:14; 71:15,16,19; 72:1-3; 89:16; Isa 45:24,25; Jer 23:6 Php 3:7-9; Re 15:3,4; 19:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-8","title":"Psalms 145:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Lord is gracious. 86:5,15; 100:5; 103:8; 116:5; Ex 34:6,7; Nu 14:18; Da 9:9; Jon 4:2 Mic 7:18-20; Ro 5:20,21; Eph 1:6,8; 2:4 of great mercy. Heb. great in mercy.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-9","title":"Psalms 145:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>good. 25:8; 36:6,7; 65:9-13; 104:27; Jon 4:11; Na 1:7; Mt 5:45; Ac 14:17 Ac 17:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-10","title":"Psalms 145:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>All thy. 19:1; 96:11-13; 98:3-9; 103:22; 104:24; 148:1-13; Isa 43:20 Isa 44:23; Ro 1:19,20 and thy saints. 22:23; 30:4; 32:11; 97:12; 135:19-21; 148:14; Isa 43:21; Heb 13:15 1Pe 2:5,9; Re 7:9-12; 19:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-11","title":"Psalms 145:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the glory. 2:6-8; 45:6,7; 72:1-20; 93:1,2; 96:10-13; 97:1-12; 99:1-4 1Ch 29:11,12; Isa 9:6,7; 24:23; 33:21,22; Da 7:13,14; Zec 9:9 Mt 6:13; Mr 11:9,10; Re 5:12,13; 11:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-12","title":"Psalms 145:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>make known. 98:1; 105:5; 106:2; 110:2,3; 145:6-12; 136:4-26; Da 4:34,35 Mt 28:18; Ac 2:8-11; Eph 1:19-21; 3:7,8; Re 12:10; 19:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-13","title":"Psalms 145:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>kingdom. 146:10; Isa 9:7; Da 2:44; 7:14,27; 1Ti 1:17; Re 11:15 everlasting kingdom. Heb. kingdom of all ages. 1Co 15:21-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-14","title":"Psalms 145:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>upholdeth. 37:24; 94:18; 119:117; Lu 22:31,32 raiseth up. 38:6; 42:5; 146:8; Lu 13:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-15","title":"Psalms 145:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>The eyes. 9; 104:21,27; 136:25; 147:8,9; Ge 1:30; Job 38:39-41; Joe 2:22 Mt 6:26; Lu 12:24; Ac 17:25 wait upon thee. or, look unto thee.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-16","title":"Psalms 145:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>openest. 104:28; 107:9; 132:15; Job 38:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-17","title":"Psalms 145:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>righteous. 50:6; 89:14; 97:2; 99:3,4; 103:6; Ge 18:25; De 32:4; 1Sa 2:2,3 Isa 45:21; Zep 3:5; Zec 9:9; Ro 3:5,6,25,26; Re 4:8; 15:3,4 Re 16:5-7; 19:2,11 holy. or, merciful, or bountiful.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-18","title":"Psalms 145:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>nigh unto. 34:18; 46:1,5; De 4:7; 1Ki 18:27,28; Isa 58:9; Joh 14:23; Jas 4:8 call upon. 17:1; 119:2; Pr 15:8; Isa 1:15,16; Jer 29:12,13; Ho 7:14; Mt 6:5-8 Mt 23:14; Joh 4:24; 1Jo 3:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-19","title":"Psalms 145:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>fulfil. 20:4; 34:9; 36:7,8; 37:4,19; Mt 5:6; Lu 1:53; Joh 15:7,16; 16:24 Eph 3:16-20; 1Jo 5:15 he also will. 34:17; 37:39,40; 91:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-20","title":"Psalms 145:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>preserveth. 31:23; 37:28; 97:10; Ex 20:6; Joh 10:27-29; Ro 8:28-30; Jas 2:5 1Pe 1:5-8 all the wicked. 1:6; 9:17; Mt 25:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-145-21","title":"Psalms 145:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":145,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":145,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>My mouth. 1,2,5; 30:12; 51:15; 71:8,15,23,24; 89:1 let all flesh. 67:3,4; 86:9; 103:22; 117:1,2; 150:6; Re 5:11-14</p>"}]}